// Whether a store's value is a block made at this very expression that nothing
// else names: a fresh string (str_fresh_node), or the closure a `bind` makes
// (docs/MEMORY.md 3.5), whose object and the lists it copied belong to it alone.
// Bit 16 of the store walk (kind.id) is what lets a name own it.

esc_fresh_obj(int e) {
  int ok = str_fresh_node(e);
  if((import nkind)[e] == "call" && (import ns1)[e] == "bind") {
    ok = 1;
  }
} return int ok;
given esc_sfix {
